---

<section class="fullwidth-section identity-section-clean" id="philosophy">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Section Header (100% Pure English) -->
    <div class="section-title-clean">
      <span class="sub-tag red-text">BRAND PHILOSOPHY & IDENTITY</span>
      <h2 class="main-title">
        Strategic Values of <span class="red-text">PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="subtitle-text">
        Measured business transformation oriented towards physical sector sustainability in Krui, Pesisir Barat.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Strategic Pivot Text Block (No cards) -->
    <div class="pivot-text-block">
      <span class="pivot-tag red-text">STRATEGIC PIVOT BACKGROUND</span>
      <h3 class="pivot-title">Transformation to Real Business Sector (Krui, Pesisir Barat)</h3>
      <p class="paragraph">
        The strategic decision to expand into the real physical business sector in Krui, Pesisir Barat, represents a measured and sustainability-oriented transformation. Unlike high-speculation business models, physical business operations in this high-potential area provide a solid foundation through <strong>stable daily cash flow (real cash flow)</strong>, tangible <strong>physical asset availability</strong>, and a measurably real market share.
      </p>
      <p class="paragraph" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
        Retaining the entity name PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT preserves strategic brand equity. The word <strong>"Chain"</strong> is professionally reoriented to represent <em>Supply Chain</em> reliability and Business Value Chain integration that mutually reinforce local and regional business ecosystems.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Pillars Breakdown (No Cards) -->
    <div class="pillars-clean" id="pilar">
      <h3 class="pillars-heading">Entity Naming & Operational Philosophy</h3>

      <div class="pillar-clean-row">
        <div class="pillar-number red-text">01</div>
        <div class="pillar-detail">
          <h4 class="pillar-name-text">CHAIN <span class="pillar-sub red-text">(Supply Chain & Partnership)</span></h4>
          <p class="pillar-desc-text">
            <strong>Operational Perspective:</strong> Symbolizes integrated supply chain strength, service quality reliability, and strategic long-term B2B partnership commitments with local accommodation, hospitality, and partner network stakeholders.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-clean-row">
        <div class="pillar-number red-text">02</div>
        <div class="pillar-detail">
          <h4 class="pillar-name-text">ASIA <span class="pillar-sub red-text">(Vision & Professional Standards)</span></h4>
          <p class="pillar-desc-text">
            <strong>Operational Perspective:</strong> Symbolizes the application of professional-grade operational standards, broad business development perspective, and facility readiness in serving domestic and international market segments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-clean-row">
        <div class="pillar-number red-text">03</div>
        <div class="pillar-detail">
          <h4 class="pillar-name-text">CONECT <span class="pillar-sub red-text">(Physical Solution Bridge)</span></h4>
          <p class="pillar-desc-text">
            <strong>Operational Perspective:</strong> Symbolizes the company's role as a comprehensive solution provider connecting operational field needs with responsive and efficient physical service availability.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .identity-section-clean {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .section-title-clean {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .sub-tag {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .main-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .subtitle-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Pivot Block */
  .pivot-text-block {
    padding: 2.25rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .pivot-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .pivot-title {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .paragraph {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  /* Pillars Clean Row */
  .pillars-clean {
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .pillars-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .pillar-clean-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .pillar-clean-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .pillar-number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    width: 45px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pillar-detail {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .pillar-name-text {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .pillar-sub {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pillar-desc-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pillar-clean-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>
